        {
          "id": 2583262914,
          "type": "DiffNote",
          "body": "This will remove the `Associate IMSI` from `IE IMSI`, which is opposite of what I mention. I don't have a problem that there is a `Associate IMSI` there AND under `Session 1`. The data which be used under `Session 1` is from `IE IMSI`, hence no new data is used only already saved.\n\nLet's keep the default `dissect_e212_imsi()` as is, and give better visibility to the user so that in first Request message they can already see in the buttom which `Associate IMSI` it belongs",
